--- !u!114 &3296820198232828324
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1542002095801447270}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#8B0000><size=120%><b>Jan 2nd, Saturday</b></size></color>\r\nDear
    diary:\r\n\r\nToday's being pretty okay.\r\n\r\nI don't think I've been thinking
    enough...Or maybe...I do?\r\n\r\nThe brewery of wine takes years; so, what eventually
    get compiled from thoughts into ideas might take more.\r\n\r\nI've been having
    a thought for years, and now what I need to do is just, to make it come true.\n\n<page>\nGood
    thing happened today:\n\nI ate icecream. After doing this it got freezing cold,
    though. Maybe I won't ate in during snowy day anymore.\n\nIt's 2 :00 am, I've
    got to sleep now. Bye, my dear diary. And sleep well.\n\n\n<page><color=#4B0082><size=120%><b>Jan
    22th, Friday</b></size></color>\nDear Diary:\n\nI haven't been seeing you for
    half a month.\n\nSometimes, I want to walk straight from home to anywhere else,
    or everywhere, even. Just wandering around without having to think about anything.\n\nToday
    is the second time I tried to do so, but I failed. It was just too cold and whever
    I got further away from home, I kinda missed the warmth in the bed.\n\n<page>\nGood
    thing happened today:\n\nI got a new shovel!\n\nNow I can plant the seed sometimes
    when the weather gets warmer.\n\n<page><color=#003366><size=120%><b>Feb 3rd,
    Wednesday </b></size></color>\nDear diary:\nToday I felt bored! \n\nI don't have
    much to talk about, honestly. The only thing I think of right now is just how
    fast the days have past. I mean, the last year past in a blink, and even now,
    I never realized until I saw on the calender it's already Feburary.\n\nEvery
    day is plain and, almost the same. I woke up at morning, and went to the underground,
    and back to the surface of the globe again, to work, or just taking a walk.\n\n<page>\nGood
    thing happened today:\n\nNothing happened! Just ordinary day, I guess. At least
    no one has shouted at me for arriving late by half an hour. \n\nI didn't mean
    it! But getting engrossed by the concept of passed subway has made me to missed
    the next one as well.\n\n<page><color=#006400><size=120%><b>March 18th, Thursday</b></size></color>\nToday
    I learned how to make diary flower.\n\n<page> \n\n<page><color=#B8860B><size=120%><b>????</b></size></color>\n\n<page>"
